{\Large\itshape\color{CoverGoldBright} ποιηταὶ λόγου}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "Doers of the Word"} · 行道的人——全書貫穿的呼召 (1:22)}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
本書逐段研讀雅各書全書五章，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹，整合老弟兄查經教導法、John Calvin 與 G. Campbell Morgan 的歷代注疏、以及 John MacArthur 逐節解經講道（gty.org）。正文五步——試煉熬煉出真信心、真信心必有真行為、真智慧馴服舌頭、真謙卑順服神、真忍耐盼望主來——之後，另加六篇跨書卷專題深論，把雅各書擺回箴言、利未記、阿摩司書、詩篇、傳道書與彼得前書旁邊，讀出這卷書從頭到尾早已站在整本聖經的智慧傳統與先知傳統裏說話。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ verse-by-verse study of all five chapters of James, built on the order of revelation, integrating Elder Wong's Bible teaching, the historical commentary of John Calvin and G. Campbell Morgan, and John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition (gty.org) --- followed by six cross-canonical studies placing James beside Proverbs, Leviticus, Amos, the Psalms, Ecclesiastes, and 1 Peter, so that the reader hears this epistle speaking, from its first line to its last, in the wisdom and prophetic traditions of the whole Bible.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 五步：從聽道到行道}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Five Steps: From Hearing to Doing}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
\begin{tabular}{@{}cp{3.4in}l@{}}
第一步 & 試煉熬煉出真信心 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Trials refine a true faith} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:2-12}\\[0.25em]
第二步 & 真信心必有真行為 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} True faith bears true works} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:14-26}\\[0.25em]
第三步 & 真智慧馴服舌頭 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} True wisdom tames the tongue} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 3:1-18}\\[0.25em]
第四步 & 真謙卑順服神 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} True humility submits to God} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 4:1-17}\\[0.25em]
第五步 & 真忍耐盼望主來 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} True patience awaits the Lord} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 5:7-20}\\
\end{tabular}
\end{minipage}

